    "body_html": "<h1>I(V) Measurement – Keithley 2470</h1>\n<h2>1. Measurement objective</h2>\n<p>Electrical current-voltage characterization of the selected sample.</p>\n<h2>2. Experimental setup</h2>\n<p>Instrument: Keithley 2470</p>\n<p>Measurement configuration: Source Voltage / Measure Current.</p>\n<h2>3. Measurement procedure</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Connect the sample to the Keithley 2470.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Verify electrical connections and instrument configuration.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Set voltage sweep parameters and current compliance.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Perform forward voltage sweep (V_Start → V_Stop).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Perform backward voltage sweep (V_Stop → V_Start).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Save the acquired current-voltage data.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>4. Data and results</h2>\n<p>Raw data file: see attached CSV file.</p>\n<h2>5. Experimental notes</h2>\n<p>[Add relevant observations, anomalies or additional information.]</p>"
